kerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1228183722,"text":"うむ…そんなところじゃ。軽く掃除すればよい…","nextNodeIds":[727380102]},{"nodeId":727380102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3429400226,"text":"おや？童よ、奇遇じゃな。","nextNodeIds":[727380103,727380104]},{"nodeId":727380103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2979305002,"text":"奇遇？","nextNodeIds":[727380105]},{"nodeId":727380105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1497282418,"text":"おや、「また面倒事を押し付けてきそうだ」とでも考えてそうな顔をしておるな。","nextNodeIds":[727380106]},{"nodeId":727380106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2290494930,"text":"安心するがよい。たった今、社の改修を終えて、新しい業務を始めようとしていたところじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[727380107]},{"nodeId":727380107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2704565338,"text":"まだ公表しておらぬのに汝がやってきたのじゃから、奇遇といえるじゃろう？","nextNodeIds":[727380108]},{"nodeId":727380108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1675901314,"text":"ほれ、妾の横にある賽銭箱が見えるか？願い事をする場所が増えたのじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[727380109]},{"nodeId":727380109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3913618842,"text":"もうおみくじがあるけど？","nextNodeIds":[727380110]},{"nodeId":727380110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3909325690,"text":"それは違う。おみくじは運勢を占うもの、これは…「願い事」をするためのものじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[727380111]},{"nodeId":727380111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3183191018,"text":"目を閉じて願いを心に思い描く。そして、その願いを絵馬に書き、横の絵馬掛けに吊るす。そしたら、願いが叶うかもしれぬ。","nextNodeIds":[727380112]},{"nodeId":727380112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2743884202,"text":"どんな願いでもいいの？","nextNodeIds":[727380113]},{"nodeId":727380113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1529923874,"text":"もちろん。じゃが、具体的にどれくらい実現するかは、神様次第といったところじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[727380114]},{"nodeId":727380114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":348421138,"text":"妾は役立たずの宮司じゃからのう。せいぜい人間関係の面で、何か策を出してやることくらいしかできぬ。","nextNodeIds":[727380115,727380116]},{"nodeId":727380115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1641017826,"text":"新しい友達に会えたら嬉しい。","nextNodeIds":[727380117]},{"nodeId":727380117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3805301018,"text":"それが汝の願いであれば、試してみるがよい。ほれ、この「みくじ短冊」を持っていけ。","nextNodeIds":[727380118]},{"nodeId":727380118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":4030174842,"text":"これは「おみくじ」を書く時に残ったものじゃ、汝にくれてやろう。","nextNodeIds":[727380119]},{"nodeId":727380119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3713260466,"text":"願い事をそこに書いてからお祈りすると、もっと効果があるかもしれぬ。","nextNodeIds":[727380120]},{"nodeId":727380120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3304041898,"text":"本当に？","nextNodeIds":[727380121]},{"nodeId":727380121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3352798298,"text":"おや、妾が嘘をついたことがあったか？早く、願い事をしに行くがよい。","nextNodeIds":[727380122]},{"nodeId":727380122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1794824874,"text":"願いを書いた「みくじ短冊」を絵馬に貼り付け、最後に絵馬掛けに吊るす…","nextNodeIds":[727380123]},{"nodeId":727380123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2412458330,"text":"これで、完了じゃ。","nextNodeIds":[727380124]},{"nodeId":727380124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3070804234,"text":"うむ、心が込もっておる。","nextNodeIds":[727380125]},{"nodeId":727380125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1066532978,"text":"本当に効果あるの…？","nextNodeIds":[727380126]},{"nodeId":727380126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":6254402,"text":"さあ、引き続き頑張るがよい。ちゃんと目を見開いておくことじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[727380127]},{"nodeId":727380127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2280021930,"text":"もしかしたら、汝が会いたい人は、どこかのラーメン屋でラーメンを食べておるかもしれぬ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":727380116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3578287666,"text":"旧友たちに会うのも悪くない…","nextNodeIds":[727380117]},{"nodeId":727380104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":627304122,"text":"待って、その言い方…","nextNodeIds":[727380105]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7273801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1034"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7273801],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","count":19},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":8}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[172738],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2441985782,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/NodKrai_72738/Q7273801","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDK